WEBVTT

00:16.270 --> 00:17.450
Your sword...

00:17.450 --> 00:20.950
Every time it breaks, 
it regenerates, doesn't it?

00:21.350 --> 00:22.500
In a split second...

00:22.500 --> 00:26.960
Reiren's barriers worked just fine.

00:27.470 --> 00:31.880
But your sword regenerated instantly
as it broke through each one.

00:33.080 --> 00:35.440
This indeed is the work of heaven,

00:35.440 --> 00:39.310
an absolute power that cannot be 
blocked by a mere magic item.

00:41.910 --> 00:43.890
There is no need for magic items.

00:43.890 --> 00:46.370
There is no need for celestials!

00:46.370 --> 00:48.940
Acknowledge me, the hero, 
to be crowned in the heavens

00:49.460 --> 00:51.660
and simply be my slave.

00:53.100 --> 00:54.980
Divine Gift of the King's Sword!

00:57.590 --> 01:03.520
I thought the four heroes fought
 to protect their people.

01:04.790 --> 01:07.000
The prattling of a weak race.

01:07.880 --> 01:09.260
I'll show you...

01:09.910 --> 01:12.250
the spirit we humans have built up...

01:13.550 --> 01:15.580
because of that weakness.

01:28.270 --> 01:32.820
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

02:47.100 --> 02:52.020
<b>Episode 8
"Celestial Purgatory"</b>

02:55.110 --> 02:56.880
Reiren, are you all right?

02:57.330 --> 02:58.900
Of course I am.

02:59.280 --> 03:00.320
However...

03:04.830 --> 03:05.700
Disappear!

03:10.330 --> 03:14.180
Return to dust!

03:21.160 --> 03:22.970
Clever bastard...

03:23.510 --> 03:26.750
In terms of just sword skills, is Kai better?

03:26.750 --> 03:27.850
I think so.

03:28.360 --> 03:29.390
Still...

03:30.110 --> 03:33.270
I no longer need this!

03:37.950 --> 03:39.260
Collapse.

03:55.030 --> 03:57.960
Is he about to drop the angel palace?!

03:59.260 --> 04:00.580
Lend me your strength.

04:01.990 --> 04:04.070
Let's defeat Alfreya!

04:07.810 --> 04:08.930
I'm not done yet!

04:19.560 --> 04:21.000
You fool!

04:23.010 --> 04:26.280
It's over... human.

04:28.250 --> 04:30.490
<i>He's not coming to his senses...</i>

04:30.490 --> 04:32.350
<i>unlike with Vanessa...</i>

04:34.120 --> 04:36.330
Respond, seven princesses.

04:47.870 --> 04:50.720
Longbow of the Moon, True Moon!

04:52.730 --> 04:55.370
We only get one chance. Don't miss.

04:55.370 --> 04:56.770
Of course!

04:59.860 --> 05:01.440
Pierce through!

05:32.430 --> 05:35.520
You inferior race!

05:36.350 --> 05:38.440
Just... one more attack!

05:38.770 --> 05:40.860
Die!

05:42.530 --> 05:44.740
I'll turn the tables on you!

06:08.600 --> 06:10.930
How terrible...

06:11.480 --> 06:15.700
To think I would be the one 
to lose his wings and fall to earth...

06:16.270 --> 06:18.540
Have you come to your senses?

06:19.430 --> 06:20.810
Lord Alfreya!

06:23.670 --> 06:27.150
This place... will soon fall.

06:28.450 --> 06:31.580
Make haste... and get to safety.

06:32.990 --> 06:36.480
Reiren... I no longer...

06:36.900 --> 06:39.440
deserve to be... adored by you.

06:40.530 --> 06:41.670
That's not true...

06:49.730 --> 06:54.220
Tell the celestials...

06:55.650 --> 06:59.720
that this was... all my doing.

07:00.490 --> 07:01.580
Reiren...

07:04.440 --> 07:08.170
<i>It's the same as what happened to Vanessa.</i>

07:08.170 --> 07:09.950
Human...

07:10.990 --> 07:14.700
I... received something from Sid.

07:15.800 --> 07:17.370
He entrusted to me...

07:17.810 --> 07:20.080
these words.

07:21.370 --> 07:26.860
It exists... no, it was supposed to exist...

07:27.800 --> 07:29.900
That's what Sid told me...

07:30.800 --> 07:32.480
Supposed to exist?

07:33.330 --> 07:35.870
What was he talking about?

07:35.870 --> 07:38.780
I don't know. But...

07:38.780 --> 07:41.360
He was very frustrated.

07:41.360 --> 07:42.270
What?

07:42.270 --> 07:49.130
Listen, human... The cause of 
the world reincarnation is...

07:49.980 --> 07:51.240
Hatred.

07:52.730 --> 07:56.700
I... acknowledge you.

07:58.260 --> 07:59.870
Even though you're human,

07:59.870 --> 08:04.060
the sight of you risking your life for an elf...

08:04.840 --> 08:06.150
That itself may have been...

08:08.950 --> 08:13.340
what activated the taboo code...

08:14.460 --> 08:20.320
Shatter... the hatred that lurks in this world!

08:26.530 --> 08:28.160
Lord Alfreya...

08:44.540 --> 08:46.170
Lord Alfreya...

08:48.610 --> 08:49.840
I see.

08:50.260 --> 08:52.800
I'm glad everyone is safe.

08:52.800 --> 08:56.240
Still, we angels were unable to do anything

08:56.240 --> 08:58.910
despite noticing the changes in our Lord.

08:59.320 --> 09:02.000
That goes for the elves as well.

09:02.570 --> 09:04.520
Allow me to ask one thing.

09:05.190 --> 09:07.480
When did Alfreya's behavior change?

09:07.990 --> 09:11.940
Could it be when that monster 
he referred to as his subordinate,

09:12.440 --> 09:15.110
Last Riser, appeared?

09:15.380 --> 09:16.420
That's right.

09:16.890 --> 09:19.570
It was when that thing appeared

09:19.570 --> 09:23.830
that our Lord began to grow 
distant from his fellow angels.

09:26.870 --> 09:28.540
<i>If it was the hero's subordinate,</i>

09:29.510 --> 09:31.690
<i>why would it attack him?</i>

09:33.410 --> 09:37.630
<i>That thing first appeared 
when I rescued Rinne.</i>

09:38.380 --> 09:40.830
<i>It was as if it were monitoring her.</i>

09:42.950 --> 09:46.720
<i>Is Rinne going to be targeted again?</i>

09:48.060 --> 09:50.980
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

09:51.060 --> 09:53.980
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

10:05.720 --> 10:06.570
Rinne!

10:11.810 --> 10:13.750
Were you the ones who did this?!

10:18.490 --> 10:19.560
Rinne...

10:23.620 --> 10:24.300
Oh, Kai!

10:24.300 --> 10:25.190
H-Hey...

10:27.180 --> 10:28.890
I'm glad you woke up.

10:29.700 --> 10:30.820
Are you okay?

10:31.220 --> 10:32.090
Yeah...

10:33.090 --> 10:36.750
I was worried about how 
long you were sleeping.

10:37.770 --> 10:41.540
I had a dream. A scary dream.

10:42.890 --> 10:44.060
I see.

10:45.370 --> 10:46.950
May I intrude?

10:46.950 --> 10:49.120
Jeannie! When did you get here?!

10:49.120 --> 10:50.930
I've been here this whole time.

10:50.930 --> 10:52.960
You only see Kai, don't you?

10:52.960 --> 10:55.360
U-Um...

10:58.590 --> 11:00.050
I told you, didn't I?

11:00.050 --> 11:03.720
That once the fight was over, 
I'd be asking about you...

11:04.250 --> 11:06.310
Y-Yeah...

11:08.920 --> 11:10.220
I see...

11:11.070 --> 11:14.020
I was warned by Falin to be cautious,

11:14.020 --> 11:17.730
and I had a feeling you weren't human.

11:18.420 --> 11:22.600
But you don't even know what race you are, huh?

11:23.190 --> 11:24.070
Yeah.

11:25.100 --> 11:26.970
I'm sorry for not telling you this whole time.

11:27.570 --> 11:31.790
Did you think that I'd burn you 
at the stake if you told the truth?

11:32.240 --> 11:34.610
It would be a natural act for 
a Rebel Army commander.

11:34.610 --> 11:35.090
What?

11:35.090 --> 11:38.940
You're right, I would have probably 
thought you were a demon spy.

11:38.940 --> 11:40.140
What?!

11:40.660 --> 11:42.940
But Kai told me...

11:44.020 --> 11:47.930
that you challenged the hero 
of the demons with him

11:47.930 --> 11:50.150
and you even saved me, a human.

11:52.780 --> 11:56.600
With achievements like that, 
I really have to believe you.

11:57.620 --> 11:59.150
Jeannie...

11:59.150 --> 12:04.030
Yeah, you have my word 
that Rinne is on humanity's side.

12:05.340 --> 12:09.200
For me... being with Kai is really all I need...

12:10.610 --> 12:15.320
But I kind of feel happy 
that you believe in me, Jeannie.

12:16.550 --> 12:18.920
Yes, I feel the same way.

12:19.550 --> 12:22.840
I feel like we should tell Saki and Ashran, too,

12:23.550 --> 12:25.390
but they might really be shocked.

12:25.390 --> 12:28.430
Yes, even if they're all right with it,

12:28.430 --> 12:31.270
it may cause discord 
among the other soldiers.

12:31.870 --> 12:36.640
Therefore, I believe it'd be better to keep 
this secret to ourselves a bit longer.

12:37.670 --> 12:39.860
Okay, a secret then.

12:42.940 --> 12:46.860
Um... May I touch them?

12:47.320 --> 12:48.080
Huh?

12:49.540 --> 12:53.210
Oh... they're so soft!

12:53.210 --> 12:55.310
Y-Yeah...

12:56.670 --> 12:57.670
What's wrong?

12:57.670 --> 13:01.510
Um... I-It tickles...

13:03.730 --> 13:04.880
Oh?

13:05.150 --> 13:07.860
Ah! H-Hey, Jeannie!

13:11.710 --> 13:13.480
Is this the spot? Or here?!

13:13.480 --> 13:17.230
Ah, Jeannie is being mean to me!

13:18.490 --> 13:20.630
I'm sorry, I couldn't help myself.

13:25.460 --> 13:26.820
For the next year,

13:27.330 --> 13:31.280
humans will not be allowed 
to enter our vast forest.

13:32.020 --> 13:35.860
Celestials will not be allowed 
to enter human cities.

13:36.740 --> 13:38.850
Do we have an agreement,

13:38.850 --> 13:41.220
Human Commander Jeanne?

13:41.860 --> 13:43.510
Understood.

13:43.510 --> 13:47.930
I'll see to it that the Io Rebel Army 
abides by your terms.

13:48.580 --> 13:53.790
Then the truce is officially forged.

13:54.510 --> 13:57.530
The witnesses will be everyone 
who is present here.

14:03.480 --> 14:04.670
What's this?

14:04.670 --> 14:06.150
Please take it.

14:12.380 --> 14:14.430
The Longbow of the Moon.

14:14.430 --> 14:16.220
But it was damaged. How...

14:17.210 --> 14:19.260
Are these...

14:19.720 --> 14:23.300
They're the bullets you were 
using to cancel magic.

14:23.860 --> 14:25.840
These are modified elven bullets?

14:26.200 --> 14:27.800
Is that what they're called?

14:28.350 --> 14:30.830
When I spoke of the kind of weapons you use,

14:30.830 --> 14:34.640
the dwarves took interest in them 
and built these right away.

14:35.160 --> 14:39.860
By the way, I was the one 
who smelted the iris ore of those bullets.

14:39.860 --> 14:42.800
You should name them something like 
"Sacred Light Elven Bullets."

14:43.480 --> 14:45.380
Real elven-made bullets, huh?

14:46.290 --> 14:47.710
Amazing.

14:48.540 --> 14:50.410
It is our thanks to you.

14:50.900 --> 14:56.340
If it hadn't been for you, the celestials 
would have plunged into civil war.

14:57.820 --> 15:01.470
Additionally, you are planning to fight against

15:01.470 --> 15:05.170
the spirits to the south and the mythical 
beasts to the west, aren't you?

15:05.470 --> 15:10.510
My apologies, but we cannot allow
 other races to know of our plans.

15:10.940 --> 15:12.460
A wise decision.

15:13.000 --> 15:18.850
Either way, you will need to pass 
through celestial forests and fields.

15:18.850 --> 15:21.700
Will you not need a guide?

15:22.440 --> 15:25.690
I suppose we may, however...

15:26.460 --> 15:30.700
I will have one of our 
representatives accompany you.

15:31.560 --> 15:33.540
I don't understand your reasoning.

15:33.540 --> 15:35.100
Could you please elaborate?

15:36.680 --> 15:41.370
We want to know what, exactly, 
happened to Lord Alfreya.

15:41.900 --> 15:46.780
When I think back on it, 
it was then that he began to act strangely.

15:46.780 --> 15:48.130
Then?

15:48.510 --> 15:54.680
About ten years ago, 
Lord Alfreya confronted an intruder,

15:54.680 --> 15:57.100
who had crossed the western border...

15:57.850 --> 16:02.360
The hero of the mythical beasts, 
the Fang King, Rath=IE...

16:03.630 --> 16:05.650
I saw them.

16:05.650 --> 16:07.890
Neither had subordinates with them.

16:07.890 --> 16:10.280
They confronted each other for a few hours...

16:11.040 --> 16:12.700
However, that sight...

16:13.270 --> 16:17.110
made it seem like they were 
colluding and conspiring something.

16:17.910 --> 16:23.970
It was soon after that the Last Riser 
appeared at our Lord's side.

16:24.750 --> 16:26.020
I see.

16:26.610 --> 16:33.280
So you wish to aid our expedition 
in return for learning the truth.

16:34.760 --> 16:37.760
How heartless of you, Great Elder.

16:38.460 --> 16:41.470
Whoever accompanies them 
is effectively a hostage.

16:41.810 --> 16:43.470
If anyone were to break the truce,

16:43.470 --> 16:45.440
they would be the first to get executed.

16:45.810 --> 16:48.440
Who would ever volunteer 
to be a sacrifice like—

16:48.440 --> 16:49.650
You will.

16:49.650 --> 16:53.860
Oh, I will. What a shame for— Huh?

16:54.370 --> 16:57.740
You will accompany them, Reiren.

16:57.740 --> 16:59.470
Hold on a minute!

16:59.470 --> 17:03.120
What's the meaning of this?!
 I had heard nothing of this!

17:03.120 --> 17:04.870
That's because I've just now decided.

17:04.870 --> 17:06.370
Why is it me?

17:06.650 --> 17:13.820
Because you haven't budged one step 
from that human named Kai.

17:13.820 --> 17:14.550
Wha?!

17:14.550 --> 17:17.070
Yes! I was wondering about that, too!

17:17.550 --> 17:19.550
N-No, you have it all wrong!
I just happened to be—

17:19.550 --> 17:23.640
You can't try to play it off. 
You're after Kai, aren't you?!

17:23.970 --> 17:26.350
What are you talking about?!

17:26.910 --> 17:30.070
Don't just stand there! Say something!

17:30.600 --> 17:34.620
Well, I'd be happy to have you, Reiren.

17:34.620 --> 17:35.570
H-Hey!

17:35.570 --> 17:38.990
Then I'm counting on you, Reiren.

17:39.730 --> 17:43.680
D-Don't say unreasonable things!

17:51.320 --> 17:54.300
Make a truce with the celestials, huh?

17:54.870 --> 17:58.510
It comes with a one year limit, 
but it's a big step forward.

17:59.160 --> 18:01.890
I would like to leave the rest 
to the Io Rebel Army.

18:02.220 --> 18:04.850
Of course, Jeanne.

18:05.770 --> 18:06.890
Dante.

18:07.560 --> 18:11.720
We greatly appreciate the generous 
supplies you offered for our expedition.

18:12.610 --> 18:19.030
The Urza and Io Rebel Armies 
failed to work together.

18:19.030 --> 18:22.720
Your Majesty, surely that is...

18:23.300 --> 18:28.040
To defeat the hero of 
the celestials and form a truce...

18:28.530 --> 18:31.430
If you just look at the result, 
it's a victory for humanity.

18:32.520 --> 18:37.840
However, that means that the tactics you've
 employed up until now will no longer work.

18:38.730 --> 18:42.290
Now that we've defeated 
both the demon and celestial heroes,

18:42.290 --> 18:44.840
they'll no longer take us humans lightly.

18:45.860 --> 18:49.210
The spirits and the mythical beasts 
will change their perception of us.

18:50.010 --> 18:53.770
They'll consider us a substantial threat.

18:54.120 --> 18:55.400
Precisely.

18:55.830 --> 19:00.230
To counter that, collaboration between 
Rebel Armies will become essential.

19:01.210 --> 19:03.480
The commander of the Yulun Rebel Army,

19:03.480 --> 19:07.950
which fights against the spirits to the south...

19:08.290 --> 19:10.840
is the Lion King, Balmung.

19:12.260 --> 19:16.390
I've heard he's an old acquaintance 
of yours and a veteran hero.

19:16.390 --> 19:17.430
Is that true?

19:18.530 --> 19:20.680
I am indebted to him.

19:21.490 --> 19:24.320
There's no doubt that he is a great commander.

19:25.060 --> 19:29.940
What you're saying is that he's a 
commander you can trust, unlike me.

19:29.940 --> 19:31.440
Not at all.

19:35.140 --> 19:37.950
Surprise attack tactics will no longer 
work on the other races.

19:38.540 --> 19:40.620
You're in for a head-on battle.

19:41.590 --> 19:44.470
If you truly do consider Balmung 
a trustworthy commander,

19:44.780 --> 19:48.830
you'll want to establish a proper 
alliance force with them.

19:49.730 --> 19:51.360
I repeat,　

19:51.360 --> 19:53.700
you're going to need to change your tactics.

19:54.380 --> 19:55.940
It's unfortunate.

19:56.890 --> 19:58.050
What?

19:58.700 --> 20:00.980
Pardon my rudeness.

20:01.550 --> 20:04.510
However, I see through your situation.

20:05.270 --> 20:07.480
If you simply threw away 
that little ego of yours,

20:07.480 --> 20:10.720
you could potentially 
be a leader to all humanity.

20:11.860 --> 20:17.530
Enough talk. I'll leave that to you, Jeanne.

20:18.380 --> 20:24.200
I have no intention of taking on 
such a grand role as leading humanity.

20:24.910 --> 20:27.280
I just want to end the War of the Five Races.

20:27.880 --> 20:29.660
That is my wish.

20:31.820 --> 20:33.800
Then begone already,

20:34.570 --> 20:37.710
before the spirits and mythical beasts 
decide to make their move...

20:46.760 --> 20:48.640
It's been a while.

20:49.400 --> 20:52.270
You certainly arrived quickly.

21:00.570 --> 21:04.430
And to think you'd come without a subordinate...

21:04.430 --> 21:07.450
You must have really been 
in a hurry to get here,

21:07.970 --> 21:11.320
hero of the spirits, Rikugen Kyoko.

21:13.750 --> 21:17.610
I wasn't expecting Vanessa 
to be the very first one to fall.

21:18.520 --> 21:22.400
I suppose even that meticulous 
devil can make mistakes.

21:22.820 --> 21:24.470
Don't you think?

21:25.000 --> 21:28.230
And Alfreya's ending was just disappointing.

21:28.230 --> 21:30.600
An awful way to go out.

21:31.180 --> 21:35.210
His defeat stemmed from his small-minded nature...

21:35.660 --> 21:38.680
halfheartedly resisting the Last Riser, 
yet failing to control it.

21:39.410 --> 21:44.760
Four races, four heroes... 
Yet only the two of us remain standing.

21:45.290 --> 21:47.950
How very, very sad it is.

21:48.970 --> 21:53.200
Rath=IE, you are lying.

21:53.710 --> 21:55.410
I see.

21:55.410 --> 22:00.080
As a sage, you already
 understand the situation.

22:01.370 --> 22:03.980
Right here and now,

22:05.310 --> 22:07.390
the spirit race will disappear 
from the world!

23:34.300 --> 23:40.020
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?
